      "locked": false,
      "text": "vector<int>dp(n,1)\n\nfor(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++) :\n\n    for(int j = i-1; j >=0 ; j--):\n\n        if(arr[j] < arr[i]):\n\n            dp[i] = max(dp[i]  ,1 + dp[j] )",
